msgctxt "552"
msgid "The place is a wreck, but we're still open!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "Welcome. What can I do for you today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Actually, I'm good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "Okay, just let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "Tell me about Flawless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "What would you like to know about Flawless?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "Tell me about Flawless itself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "Flawless is the most popular hostess club in all of Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Best part is, it won't cost you an arm and a leg just to pop in for a bit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid ""
"You can find it over in Hatsumachi. There's a 5,000 yen cover charge, a "
"1,000 yen hostess-request fee, and a 1,000 yen service charge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "Tell me about Mika Tsuchiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid ""
"Mika's a caring, big-sister type. She's bright and cheerful, and she treats "
"people well, but she's not very quick to say what's on her mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "That makes it hard to get to know the real Mika."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid ""
"She's 29, a Virgo, and her blood type's O! She's apparently hooked on "
"bodyboarding right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid "She hates goya, though, so be careful if you end up taking her out to eat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... I guarantee you, once you get a taste of Mika's unique, mature "
"sex appeal, you'll be totally hooked!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "Tell me about Nao Kaneshiro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid "Nao is a polite, straight-laced girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid ""
"She has a soothing presence and loves children. I also hear that she can't "
"stand being alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid ""
"She's 25, a Capricorn, and her blood type's A! Back home, her family are "
"involved in the craft of Ryuku Bingata dyeing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "Her favorite food is chicken, but I hear she hates shiitake mushrooms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid ""
"Heh. Her eyes are absolutely stunning. You'll be totally entranced by "
"them... maybe forever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid "Tell me about Saya Unten."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid ""
"Saya is a spunky, Okinawa-born girl. With her rapid-fire way of speaking "
"and sweet, high-pitched voice, she absolutely oozes personality."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid "She's 20, a Gemini, and her blood type's B!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid "Her favorite food is pork, but she doesn't like cucumbers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid ""
"Heh... At first, you may think Saya is a bit immature. She does have a bit "
"of a childish streak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid ""
"Just wait till you catch a glimpse of her mature side, though. You'll go "
"crazy for her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid "Tell me about Aqua Sky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid ""
"Aqua Sky is a bar over in South Hatsumachi. It's quite roomy and very "
"popular⑬the perfect place to meet new people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid ""
"While you're there, don't forget to enjoy a game of pool or darts⑬if you "
"think you're up to the challenge!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid "Could I get someone to show me how to get there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1008"
msgid ""
"It seems you have someone waiting for you. You probably shouldn't keep them "
"waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid "Where to, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid "Take me to Shine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid "Shine, the hostess club?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid "Yeah, that's the one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "Take me to Jewel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "Jewel, the hostess club?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid "Yeah, that's the one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1104"
msgid "Take me to Love in Heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1116"
msgid "Love in Heart, the massage parlor?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid "Yeah, that's the one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1140"
msgid "Take me to Asia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1152"
msgid "Asia, the bikini bar?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1164"
msgid "Yeah, that's the one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid "Thank you very much. Just a moment, please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid "Hello? This is MEB calling. How are you this evening?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1200"
msgid "Um, yes, I have a guest here who'd like to come by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1212"
msgid "So we're good? Great! Thank you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1224"
msgid "Okay, sir, please follow me. I'll take you there right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1296"
msgid "I'm sorry, sir, but you, um... You seem to be a little short on cash."
msgstr ""

